# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 检出后 git diff 出现整文件差异。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须保留 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 解析可能出错。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不做文本转换。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
